---
/**
 * The Luvita wordmark. A text wordmark until a drawn one exists (DESIGN.md
 * section 12): replacing this one component replaces it everywhere.
 */
---

<span class="wordmark">Luvita</span>

<style>
  .wordmark {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-500);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
</style>
